Title, ownership, and all intellectual property rights in the Materials and Product remain exclusively with the Rightsholder until transferred in a definitive agreement. Access under this License is not a sale of IP. No implied licenses are granted by estoppel, course of dealing, or otherwise.

## 6. After sale or commercial license (supersession)

Upon **completed acquisition** (closing under a definitive purchase / asset-transfer agreement) or an **executed written commercial license** between You and the Rightsholder:

- The rights transferred or granted in that agreement **supersede** this LICENSE to the extent of any conflict;
- Surviving confidentiality, disclaimer, and limitation provisions of this LICENSE continue unless the superseding agreement expressly provides otherwise;
- Until closing or license execution, this LICENSE remains in full force.

**After sale, the Product remains proprietary unless the definitive agreement expressly converts it to an open-source license.** Public GitHub visibility after closing does not revive MIT/Apache/BSD or any other open-source grant.

Deal agreements control after execution. Drafts in diligence folders are **not** executed instruments.

